# jaxfne baseline

```python
import jaxfne as jtfne
```

Public API path: `Config -> Net -> Paradigm -> Objective -> Trainer -> Signals -> Vis/Export`.

Scientific operator path: `Emitter -> Source -> Field -> Probe -> Objective -> Optimizer` (same package; deeper layer).

Package APIs are the engine. Tutorials configure and visualize only — no notebook-local solvers, readouts, objectives, or optimizers.

Gates:

```text
truth_mode: truth_safe_unverified
claim_level: computational_scaffold
field_solver_status: laminar_proxy_no_pde
field_claim_level: proxy_readout_only
physical_amplitude_claim_allowed: false
```

Never claim real EEG/MEG, calibrated amplitude, metabolism, mechanism proof, or solved PDE/Maxwell/Poisson without solver, geometry, boundary, gauge, residual, units, calibration, and validation evidence.

Branch: publication on `cur`. Do not mutate `main`/`dev`/`agy` without approval. No force-push, tags, releases, or publish without approval.

Anchor: `internal_docs/loop_context/AGENT_QUICKREF.md`. Skills on demand: `internal_docs/skills/README.md`.
